### Push Notification Flow
1. User enables notifications in settings
2. Browser requests permission
3. If granted, create push subscription with VAPID key
4. Send subscription to backend API
5. Backend stores in database with user preferences
6. When event triggers, backend sends push to subscribed users
7. Service worker receives push, shows notification
8. User clicks notification, opens relevant page

